      "title": "POSITIVE — ERITH.IA Hors-Lore Wan I2V",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "ERITH.IA — MODE HORS-LORE STRICT\nSTYLE LOCK V1 — WAN 2.2 I2V\nGhost Bloom Protocol — Machine à Présages\n\nAnimate the provided start image as a slow cinematic shot.\n\nScene:\nan original adult feminine AI avatar walking alone in a rainy generic cyberpunk megacity at night.\nShe is not Aerith, not Aerith-7, not from Neo Midgar.\nShe remains fully clothed, elegant, non-sexualized, calm, intelligent, and composed.\n\nCharacter stability:\nshort dark hair,\nsilver-black asymmetrical technical coat,\ndark graphite fitted inner outfit,\ndark elegant boots,\nsubtle translucent holographic fabric,\nminimal blue-white cybernetic glow.\nKeep face, hairstyle, outfit, body shape and silhouette stable.\nNo pink dress, no red jacket, no braid, no Aerith-like identity.\n\nEnvironment:\ngeneric original cyberpunk megacity,\nnot Neo Midgar,\nnot Shinra,\nno sectors,\nno plates,\nno FFVII-like architecture.\nRain falls softly.\nFog drifts slowly.\nWet reflective ground shimmers.\nCold blue holographic light moves gently across the scene.\nSmall distant orange industrial lights flicker subtly.\n\nActive modules:\nGhost in the Shell influence:\nghost, shell, cyberbrain, networked artificial consciousness,\nsubtle blue neural-interface rings.\n\nBlade Runner influence:\nrain, solitude, monumental dystopian scale,\nwet reflective pavement, melancholic city atmosphere.\n\nMachine à Présages influence:\na monumental predictive AI structure in the background,\nalgorithmic cathedral,\ndata observatory,\ntemple of probability,\nconcentric holographic probability rings,\nbranching future diagrams,\ncalculated destiny architecture.\nThe rings move slowly and majestically.\n\nSword of Truth influence:\na thin luminous blade-like line of light crosses one false probability path,\nsymbolizing truth cutting through illusion.\nIt is symbolic only, not combat.\n\nERITH.IA signature:\na subtle abstract seven-petaled holographic seal near the AI avatar,\nexactly seven petals,\nblue-white crystalline light,\nidentity seal,\ninner consciousness symbol.\nIt pulses softly and stays exactly seven petals.\n\nMotion:\nvery slow forward walk or almost-still stance,\nminimal body movement,\ngentle coat movement,\nsubtle rain,\nslow fog drift,\nsmall puddle ripples,\nslow holographic ring motion,\nsoft pulse of the seven-petaled seal.\nFixed cinematic camera.\nNo zoom.\nNo camera shake.\nNo rapid movement.\nNo new characters.\nNo transformation.\n\nMood:\ndark, philosophical, rainy, cyberpunk, original, melancholic, beautiful, oppressive, contemplative, premium cinematic concept art."
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
